## Phase 2 — `02-streaming.html`

Reference when implementing streaming routes and UI.

| Mockup region | Expected behavior |
|---|---|
| Tab bar | Call-type pill on each tab (U / SS / CS / BD) when method selected |
| Call type selector row | U / SS / CS / BD tabs — layout gallery without method; locked to proto when method selected |
| Server streaming | Single request → live **message log** (scrollable), stream status dot, cancel |
| Client streaming | **Pending queue** (left) + compose (right), **Add to queue**, **Send now**, **Send all** + **End stream** |
| Bidirectional | Full-duplex log (in/out arrows), compose bar, EOF + cancel |
| Export log | **Export log** button on stream status bar → JSON download |
| Connection bar | Reuse Phase 1 target; stream-specific send labels (`▶ Start Stream`, etc.) |

**Call type source:** Execution follows `method.callType`. The selector row previews layouts via `layoutPreviewCallType` when no method is selected — see plan § Phase 2 vs mockup gap.

Reuse `GrpcResponsePanel` for **unary only**; streaming methods use the stream log region instead.

