## Selectors and CSS

- All interactive `data-testid` strings live in `src/shared/selectors/grpc.ts` — never inline in components.
- Studio styles: `src/styles/grpc-studio.css` only; no scattered grpc rules in `index.css`.
- Request/response split: fixed flex ratio in Phase 1 (mockup **01** shows ~55% request); drag resize is optional polish.
- Mockup-specific layout classes (`settings-nav`, `advanced-tab`, `diff-line`, etc.) should be namespaced under `.grpc-studio-*` or a phase-specific CSS file when implemented.

